<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>You Can Meet Me At My Hotel</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ayesha Erotica</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">You Can Meet Me At My Hotel</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3mVcWSmGxjeFHRHcJ2E7Dr</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.150" end="00:03.200">Ayesha Nicole Smith, hi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.200" end="00:11.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.160" end="00:18.400">You can meet me at my hotel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.400" end="00:22.160">With nothing on under your trench coat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.160" end="00:27.690">There's no wine, no dine, no time for it you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.690" end="00:29.190" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.970" end="00:31.640">Why don't you bring your girlfriend?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.640" end="00:35.510">The way she eyes me down excites me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.510" end="00:42.470">We'll drink some wine and find a way to get us off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.470" end="00:43.970" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.000" end="00:48.590">Lust and drugs, no intuition</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.590" end="00:50.090" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.600" end="00:54.610">Who goes first? Make your decision</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.610" end="00:56.270" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, no, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.270" end="01:02.890">If you want to I can play the victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.890" end="01:08.430">I am your vixen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.430" end="01:11.710">I can meet you in the car lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.710" end="01:15.730">I'll spread out on your hot rod</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.730" end="01:21.000">You can come and get me only when I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.000" end="01:22.500" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.800" end="01:24.960">But I think I'm liking her more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.960" end="01:27.530">She does the things I never ask for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.530" end="01:29.520" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, no, mmm, baby, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.520" end="01:34.180">You can touch and feel just don't get in the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.180" end="01:36.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.350" end="01:41.750">Lust and drugs, no intuition</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.750" end="01:43.250" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.940" end="01:47.740">Who goes first? Make your decision</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.740" end="01:49.670" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, no, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.670" end="01:56.140">If you want to I can play the victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.140" end="02:01.410">I am your vixen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.410" end="02:05.410" /></div></body></tt>